From 1b1952fbc7ca061a130c775f50b73251b1f970b1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sivasubramanaiyan Padmanaban <sivasubramaniyan.padmanaban@analog.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:54:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] media: i2c: add SG MIPI AR0234 GW5200 camera driver

- Add the SG MIPI AR0234 GW5200 camera sensor driver.
- Add AR0234 GW5200 mode and register configuration tables.
- Integrate the new camera driver into the media I2C build system.

Signed-off-by: Sivasubramanaiyan Padmanaban <sivasubramaniyan.padmanaban@analog.com>
---
 drivers/media/i2c/Makefile                    |   2 +
 drivers/media/i2c/SG_MIPI_CAM/Makefile        |   6 +
 .../SG_MIPI_CAM/sg2-mipi-ar0234-5200-tbls.h   |  66 +++
 .../i2c/SG_MIPI_CAM/sg2-mipi-ar0234-5200.c    | 434 ++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 508 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/i2c/SG_MIPI_CAM/Makefile
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/i2c/SG_MIPI_CAM/sg2-mipi-ar0234-5200-tbls.h
 create mode 100644 drivers/media/i2c/SG_MIPI_CAM/sg2-mipi-ar0234-5200.c

